  _name: The Turnip Shortage
  _description: Bring 8 turnips
  _storyDescription: The village cook has somehow used every turnip in the pantry. Bring back 8 before the stew becomes a rumor.
  _activeQuestDialogue: 'The pantry is out of turnips, and the cook has started improvising. Please bring back eight before the stew disappears from the menu.'
  _turnInDialogue: 'The turnips are back in the pantry, and the stew is saved. You have the cook and the whole village to thank you.'
  _completedQuestDialogueLines:
  - 'The turnips are here, and the cook has stopped calling the stew a rumor. Thank you.'
  - 'Eight turnips saved the village menu. I will make sure you get a bowl.'
  - 'The pantry is stocked again. The cook says you are a hero of the stew pot.'
